    "result": {"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["ok","operation","requestDigest","auditEventDigest","idempotentReplay","payload"],"properties":{"ok":{"const":true},"operation":{"$ref":"#/$defs/operation"},"requestDigest":{"$ref":"#/$defs/digest"},"auditEventDigest":{"$ref":"#/$defs/digest"},"idempotentReplay":{"const":false},"payload":{"oneOf":[{"$ref":"#/$defs/observation"},{"$ref":"#/$defs/mutationResult"}]}}},
    "transport": {"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["schema","requestSha256","status","receivedAtEpochNs","rawResponseSha256","rawResponseEnvelope"],"properties":{"schema":{"const":"serverware.nativeOAuthPendingRetirementTransport/v1"},"requestSha256":{"$ref":"#/$defs/digest"},"status":{"oneOf":[{"type":"null"},{"type":"integer","minimum":200,"maximum":599}]},"receivedAtEpochNs":{"$ref":"#/$defs/epoch"},"rawResponseSha256":{"$ref":"#/$defs/digest"},"rawResponseEnvelope":{"$ref":"oauth-exchange-authority.v1.schema.json#/$defs/envelope"}}}
  }
